  <description>
    Item for warehouse environment.

    Ported to gz-sim 8 from PX4's gazebo-classic model of the same name
    (Tools/simulation/gazebo-classic/sitl_gazebo-classic/models/big_box).
    Present only because model://parachute_package uses its mesh as the crate
    visual; nothing instantiates the model itself.
  </description>

